The photo was taken in a large grassy field with a boy standing at its center. He had slightly curly brown hair and a well-toned body. <span style="color:pink">The boy was looking off to the side, holding a soccer ball in one hand while using the other to wipe the sweat off his brow with his $FelixTop.Type, which exposes his muscled chest and the waistband of his $FelixUndies.Type.</span> <br>
<br>
Based on the amount of sweat and how tired the boy looked, it was easy to guess that he had been practicing soccer for a while. And, although his face is censored, based on his clothing, hair, and activity of choice you had no doubts that this was probably <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>. <span style="color:pink">You feel a little jealous and wonder if maybe he decided to take his shirt off after this picture and continue playing.</span> <br>
<br>
